---
---
<section id="details-rsvp" class="footer-info-section">
	<div class="info-container">

		<!-- Details Section -->
		<div class="details-grid">
			
			<!-- Card 1: Ubicación -->
			<div class="details-card info-animate">
				<div class="card-icon-wrapper">
					<svg class="card-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
						<path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"></path>
						<circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle>
					</svg>
				</div>
				<h3>Ubicación</h3>
				<span class="card-main-val">Salón Social</span>
				<p class="barrio">Torres del Porvenir</p>
				<p class="nomeclatura">Calle 54c sur No. 100 - 24, Bogotá, Colombia</p>
				<a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/hpozyuMTXLNJycin7" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="card-action-btn">
					<span>Ver en Google Maps</span>
					<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="arrow-icon">
						<line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
						<polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline>
					</svg>
				</a>
			</div>
			
			<!-- Card 2: Vestimenta -->
			<div class="details-card info-animate">
				<div class="dress-indicators">
					<div class="dress-item">
						<img src="/assets/traje.webp" alt="Icono de vestido" class="dress-icon" />
					</div>
					<div class="dress-item">
						<img src="/assets/dress.webp" alt="Icono de vestido" class="dress-icon" />
					</div>
				</div>
				<h3>Código de Traje</h3>
				<span class="card-main-val">Formal / Rigurosa Etiqueta</span>
				<p>El encanto de esta noche se viste de gala. Damas y caballeros, los invito a lucir sus mejores trajes para compartir conmigo un momento lleno de elegancia y felicidad.</p>

			</div>
			
			<!-- Card 3: Regalos -->
			<div class="details-card info-animate">
				<div class="card-icon-wrapper">
					<img src="/assets/gift-box.svg" alt="🎁">
				</div>
				<h3>Lluvia de Sobres</h3>
				<span class="card-main-val">El regalo es en Sobre</span>
				<p>Tu asistencia es nuestro mayor regalo. Pero si deseas hacernos un obsequio, dispondremos de un cofre para recibir sobres en la entrada.</p>
			</div>
			
		</div>

		<img src="/assets/012.png" alt="Sharon Valeria - 12" class="decorative-image" />

		<!-- Elegant Signature Footer -->
		<footer class="footer-signature">
			<span class="footer-calligraphy">Sharon Valeria</span>
			<span class="footer-tagline">Mis Quince Años</span>
			<div class="footer-divider"></div>
			<span class="footer-copy">valoramos su presencia en este día que quedará en la memoria de nuestra familia.</span>
		</footer>
		
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.footer-info-section {
		padding: 120px 0 60px 0;
		background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--color-bg-light) 0%, var(--color-bg-alt) 100%);
		position: relative;
		width: 100%;
		z-index: 10;
	}

	.info-container {
		max-width: 1000px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 0 20px;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 80px;
	}

	/* Details Cards Grid */
	.details-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
		gap: 30px;
	}

	.details-card {
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
		border: 1.5px solid rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.8);
		border-radius: 20px;
		padding: 40px 30px;
		text-align: center;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-metallic);
		transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.165, 0.84, 0.44, 1);
	}

	.details-card:hover {
		transform: translateY(-8px);
		border-color: rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.4);
		box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(15, 37, 71, 0.08);
	}

	.card-icon-wrapper {
		width: 60px;
		height: 60px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: rgba(30, 64, 175, 0.06);
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		margin-bottom: 25px;
		color: var(--color-text-dark);
		border: 1px solid rgba(30, 64, 175, 0.15);
	}

	.card-icon {
		width: 28px;
		height: 28px;
	}

	.details-card h3 {
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		font-size: 1.4rem;
		color: var(--color-text-dark);
		margin-bottom: 15px;
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	.card-main-val {
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		font-weight: 700;
		color: #1e40af;
		font-size: 1rem;
		letter-spacing: 1px;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		margin-bottom: 10px;
	}

	.details-card p {
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		line-height: 1.5;
		color: var(--color-silver-600);
		margin-bottom: 20px;
	}

	/* Map button */
	.card-action-btn {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 8px;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: #1e40af;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 1.5px;
		margin-top: auto;
		border-bottom: 1.5px solid rgba(30, 64, 175, 0.3);
		padding-bottom: 4px;
		transition: all 0.3s ease;
	}

	.card-action-btn:hover {
		color: var(--color-blue-900);
		border-color: var(--color-blue-900);
	}

	.arrow-icon {
		width: 14px;
		height: 14px;
		transition: transform 0.3s ease;
	}

	.card-action-btn:hover .arrow-icon {
		transform: translateX(4px);
	}

	/* Dress indicators */
	.dress-indicators {
		display: flex;
		gap: 15px;
		margin-top: auto;
	}

	.dress-item {
		background: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.1);
		border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.25);
		padding: 6px 14px;
		border-radius: 12px;
	}

	.dress-label {
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 1px;
		color: var(--color-silver-600);
	}

	/* Signature Footer */
	.footer-signature {
		text-align: center;
		margin-top: 40px;
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.2);
		padding-top: 60px;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
	}

	.footer-calligraphy {
		font-family: var(--font-accent);
		font-size: 4rem;
		color: var(--color-text-dark);
		line-height: 0.8;
		margin-bottom: 10px;
	}

	.footer-tagline {
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 5px;
		color: var(--color-silver-400);
		font-weight: 300;
		margin-bottom: 25px;
	}

	.footer-divider {
		width: 50px;
		height: 1.5px;
		background: var(--color-silver-300);
		margin-bottom: 25px;
	}

	.footer-copy {
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		letter-spacing: 1px;
		color: var(--color-silver-400);
	}

	.dress-icon {

		height: 64px;
		width: auto;
	}

	/* Responsive layouts */
	@media (max-width: 600px) {
		.footer-calligraphy {
			font-size: 3.2rem;
		}

		.footer-info-section {
			padding: 80px 0 40px 0;
		}
	}
</style>
